NEUTRAL-FORMAT FILE
This file stores all information about a structure model that can be read and
loaded by the LESM (Linear Elements Structure Model) program.
To modify the model, edit only the data below the %TAGS

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Specify version number: 'X.X'
%HEADER.VERSION
1.1

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Specify analysis model type: 'TRUSS2D', 'FRAME2D', 'Grillage', 'TRUSS3D' OR 'FRAME3D'
%HEADER.ANALYSIS
'TRUSS3D'

